{"_v":1,"id":"the-playboy-of-the-western-world-west-end-2025","cat":"west-end","cs":67,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":6,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2025/dec/12/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-lyttelton-theatre-london","d":"2025-12-12","q":"But it seems old-fashioned in this faithfully period production."},{"cn":"Claire Allfree","o":"The Telegraph","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/playboy-of-the-western-world-nicola-coughlan/","d":"2025-12-12","q":"Yet the inaudibility of much of Synge’s poetry is a major stumbling block – and the issue should have been resolved during rehearsal by the National itself."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-an-assured-turn-from-nicola-coughlan-xxvqkw6hr?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqdD7NRKY2DjPPLTBUiSrWL9J3zEDTesWo0Mk774P-xwcpq46lJxtUeD3CrxB2E%3D&gaa_ts=693c27ec&gaa_sig=4_S7ItVVSJytpyXYpF_nD9PVetsX3Ekj_kuYxEEROg0UCL5rDSsuVfpZ9u9EvrFOekVgShWnZDQL3QY8awuBBQ%3D%3D","d":"2025-12-12","q":"Eye-catching, yes, but not quite enough to make the drama seem more than a mildly intriguing period piece."},{"cn":"Holly O'Mahony","o":"London Theatre","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-national-theatre","d":"2025-12-12","q":"It’s a brilliant and satisfying production that will leave audiences thinking long after the show ends."},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"The i","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://inews.co.uk/culture/arts/playboy-of-western-world-treat-play-4099209?srsltid=AfmBOorjG0jVcfl593qhe1k-eWeG3ZxglbnHrysKCE94gKfI_QYhmQYF","d":"2025-12-12","q":"This treat of a play leaves its characters, not to mention its audience, asking themselves some long, hard questions."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The In